cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "PediTree'yi bir yayında, sunumda ya da eğitim materyalinde kullandıysanız lütfen bu şekilde atıf yapın. / If you use PediTree in a publication, presentation or teaching material, please cite it as below."
title: "PediTree: clinical pedigree drawing for genetic counselling"
type: software
abstract: "PediTree is a browser-based tool for drawing family pedigrees in standard NSGC nomenclature for genetic counselling (Turkish interface). Its graph model keeps parentage, partnerships and consanguinity structurally correct; consanguinity is derived from drawn shared ancestors. Patient data never leaves the browser: there is no server and no account."
authors:
  - family-names: "Kalenderoğlu"
    given-names: "Muhammed Doğukan"
version: "0.9.0"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/MDKalenderoglu/Peditree"
keywords:
  - pedigree
  - genetic counselling
  - clinical genetics
  - NSGC nomenclature
